; Import table of vanilla Lords of Magic SE 3.01 lomse.exe (md5 92a0d830e54a9d2934bb3e9b71dcad80).
; Source of truth companion to src/imports/iat.tsv and thunks.tsv.
; IAT at 0x0054d000 size 0x378; import directory at 0x005536f0 size 0x104.
; This is documentation / later standalone-link input. The 33 .text jmp*IAT thunks
; must keep jumping to these lomse IAT slots (harness hooks run inside lomse.exe;
; rb_part is currently built with no imports). Do not use this .def to give
; smackw32.dll its own IAT for these symbols.

LIBRARY "lomse.exe"

